sequenceDiagram
actor U as 用户
participant V as MainWindow (View)
participant C as LoginController
participant M as LoginModel
U->>V: 点击退出登录
V-->>C: logoutRequested()
C->>M: logout()
M->>M: 清空 token、userId、expiresAt
M-->>C: changed()
C->>V: applyLoginState(LoggedOut)
V->>V: 返回登录页
Note over C,M: 当前仅清除本地会话，服务端撤销会话待后续实现
